add('mix-dub-airlock',machinery,'Dub airlock','Combined-mix transients pull a high-pass down into a long pink pressure tail. Selective triggering, a 420 ms decay and tiny sustain make this a spacious counterpoint to the tight factory accents.','all',{filterType:'highpass',poles:8,cutoff:18000,amount:-5.9,decay:420,sustain:.06,hold:25,release:160,drive:4,level:10,threshold:.4,sensitivity:2.5});
add('mix-fluorescent-fold',machinery,'Fluorescent fold','An inverted white notch follower draws a bright spectral crease between source phrases. Low output level keeps the continuous notch texture subtle while the moving gap changes its colour.','all',{type:'white',filterType:'notch',poles:6,cutoff:6200,amount:-4.1,mode:'follow',invert:true,attack:7,release:48,drive:5,resonance:1.4,level:5,threshold:.16,sensitivity:3});
add('mix-hologram-dust',machinery,'Hologram dust','The combined mix opens a thin six-pole white band-pass shimmer. A 100 ms follower release bridges tiny gaps without adding an independent rhythm or copying the driver into the audio output.','all',{type:'white',filterType:'bandpass',poles:6,cutoff:2100,amount:2.2,mode:'follow',attack:6,release:100,drive:1,resonance:1.35,level:7,threshold:.09,sensitivity:4});
add('mix-ion-storm',machinery,'Ion storm','Mix accents launch a wide white low-pass burst with a twelve-pole tail. Moderate drive and a 145 ms decay give the transient a charged, stormy edge without a long sustain.','all',{type:'white',poles:12,cutoff:180,amount:5.9,decay:145,release:50,drive:9,resonance:.85,level:9,threshold:.28,sensitivity:3});
add('mix-liquid-switchboard',machinery,'Liquid switchboard','A deep pink low-pass follower rounds the combined source envelope with a 9 ms attack. The 130 ms release makes a rubbery switchboard under sparse syncopation.','all',{poles:12,cutoff:65,amount:6.8,mode:'follow',attack:9,release:130,drive:7,resonance:1.1,level:12,threshold:.13,sensitivity:3.5});
add('mix-moth-code',machinery,'Moth code','A high threshold picks larger mix accents for narrow pink band-pass taps. Short timing and a small sustain ledge turn the source rhythm into a quiet, moth-like answering code.','all',{filterType:'bandpass',poles:4,cutoff:360,amount:4.2,decay:53,sustain:.04,hold:8,release:18,drive:6,resonance:1.6,level:10,threshold:.48,sensitivity:2.5});
add('mix-negative-space',machinery,'Negative space','An inverted pink high-pass follower opens air when combined-mix energy falls away. Negative depth and 140 ms smoothing make an intentional breathing layer in the spaces between phrases.','all',{filterType:'highpass',poles:6,cutoff:18500,amount:-4.5,mode:'follow',invert:true,attack:18,release:140,drive:0,resonance:.72,level:7,threshold:.14,sensitivity:3.5});
add('mix-oxide-fountain',machinery,'Oxide fountain','Strong mix hits trigger a rising pink band-pass fountain with a grainy driven edge. A 210 ms decay gives the sweep room to speak while zero sustain keeps it out of the next phrase.','all',{filterType:'bandpass',poles:2,cutoff:210,amount:5.1,decay:210,release:65,drive:14,resonance:1.4,level:10,threshold:.33,sensitivity:3});
add('mix-pixel-frost',machinery,'Pixel frost','A white high-pass follower reveals a fine frost around the whole mix. Eight poles, fast smoothing and a restrained negative sweep keep the texture thin and tied to source detail.','all',{type:'white',filterType:'highpass',poles:8,cutoff:19500,amount:-2.4,mode:'follow',attack:1,release:36,drive:2,resonance:.75,level:6,threshold:.08,sensitivity:4});
add('mix-tunnel-lantern',machinery,'Tunnel lantern','A sixteen-pole pink low-pass lights up on larger mix transients, then fades into a dark tunnel. Its 240 ms decay and modest drive make a warm, weighty punctuation.','all',{poles:16,cutoff:45,amount:7.5,decay:240,release:80,drive:5,resonance:.8,level:13,threshold:.36,sensitivity:3});
add('x-buffer-shards',debris,'Buffer shards','X cuts launch thin white band-pass shards with a hard driven front. A 29 ms decay and selective threshold leave the gaps between chopped samples clear.','X',{type:'white',filterType:'bandpass',poles:6,cutoff:1250,amount:2.6,decay:29,release:12,drive:11,resonance:1.4,level:8,threshold:.25,sensitivity:5});
add('x-data-vapour',debris,'Data vapour','A twelve-pole pink follower turns X articulation into soft vapour. Slightly slower opening and a 150 ms release wrap the cuts in a dark contour without changing the sample itself.','X',{poles:12,cutoff:45,amount:7.6,mode:'follow',attack:16,release:150,drive:3,resonance:.78,level:12,threshold:.1,sensitivity:7});
add('x-error-lantern',debris,'Error lantern','X transients fire hollow pink band-pass knocks with a glowing resonant tail. A 170 ms decay and light sustain make the chopped source answer itself in a different register.','X',{filterType:'bandpass',poles:4,cutoff:190,amount:4.9,decay:170,sustain:.08,hold:16,release:50,drive:8,resonance:1.65,level:11,threshold:.2,sensitivity:6});
add('x-glass-shredder',debris,'Glass shredder','A white high-pass dives from 19 kHz when X crosses threshold, then snaps shut. Its short envelope supplies a glassy shredded edge rather than a constant layer of hiss.','X',{type:'white',filterType:'highpass',poles:12,cutoff:19000,amount:-3.8,decay:48,release:17,drive:7,resonance:.75,level:8,threshold:.22,sensitivity:5});
add('x-static-in-the-cracks',debris,'Static in the cracks','An inverted pink notch follower traces the spaces between X cuts. Subtle level and a short release keep the static in the cracks instead of covering the sample attacks.','X',{filterType:'notch',poles:4,cutoff:2800,amount:-3.2,mode:'follow',invert:true,attack:4,release:55,drive:9,resonance:1.2,level:6,threshold:.15,sensitivity:6});
add('l-basement-plume',dub,'Basement plume','L accents open a deep sixteen-pole pink low-pass plume. A 350 ms decay and tiny sustain shelf give sparse loops a dark basement tail without changing their original timing or pitch.','L',{poles:16,cutoff:35,amount:7.8,decay:350,sustain:.05,hold:20,release:110,drive:6,resonance:.75,level:14,threshold:.24,sensitivity:5});
add('l-echo-dust',dub,'Echo dust','A sensitive white band-pass follower catches the small details of L with a 120 ms release. This is an envelope-shaped dust layer, not an extra delay line or a change to the loop.','L',{type:'white',filterType:'bandpass',poles:2,cutoff:750,amount:3.4,mode:'follow',attack:8,release:120,drive:2,resonance:1.3,level:8,threshold:.07,sensitivity:8});
add('l-magnetic-curtain',dub,'Magnetic curtain','The L envelope lowers a steep pink high-pass curtain, revealing warm noise body as the loop speaks. A rounded opening and 180 ms release create a soft dub shadow.','L',{filterType:'highpass',poles:12,cutoff:18500,amount:-5.5,mode:'follow',attack:20,release:180,drive:5,resonance:.75,level:9,threshold:.12,sensitivity:6});
add('l-spring-ghost',dub,'Spring ghost','L transients strike a resonant pink band-pass ghost with a 260 ms decay. The hollow contour suggests spring-like colour using only N\'s existing filter, without adding reverb.','L',{filterType:'bandpass',poles:4,cutoff:280,amount:4.3,decay:260,release:75,drive:8,resonance:1.75,level:10,threshold:.22,sensitivity:5});
add('l-tape-tide',dub,'Tape tide','An inverted pink low-pass follower swells into the spaces around L phrases. A 30 ms attack and 220 ms release create a slow tape-like tide beneath the loop.','L',{poles:8,cutoff:50,amount:7.3,mode:'follow',invert:true,attack:30,release:220,drive:3,resonance:.8,level:9,threshold:.16,sensitivity:6});
add('v-choir-of-wires',phantom,'Choir of wires','V drives a resonant pink band-pass follower with a rounded onset and 170 ms release. The spectral vowel contour adds a quiet wire-choir shadow without copying vocal audio into N.','V',{filterType:'bandpass',poles:4,cutoff:320,amount:4.1,mode:'follow',attack:18,release:170,drive:5,resonance:1.7,level:11,threshold:.1,sensitivity:7});
add('v-consonant-crystals',phantom,'Consonant crystals','Sharper V consonants launch tiny white band-pass crystals. A selective threshold and 33 ms decay keep the bright, resonant punctuation separate from sustained vowels.','V',{type:'white',filterType:'bandpass',poles:6,cutoff:1800,amount:2.2,attack:1,decay:33,release:12,drive:4,resonance:1.45,level:7,threshold:.3,sensitivity:5});
add('v-ghost-syllables',phantom,'Ghost syllables','Voice crossings open a twelve-pole pink low-pass whisper with a 230 ms decay. The dark tail follows syllables while a moderate threshold avoids constant breath triggering.','V',{poles:12,cutoff:75,amount:6.5,decay:230,release:80,drive:3,resonance:.85,level:12,threshold:.24,sensitivity:6});
add('v-robot-halo',phantom,'Robot halo','A driven white notch follower bends around V articulation with a 70 ms release. Low level and an inverted response place the robotic halo around phrases rather than masking their centres.','V',{type:'white',filterType:'notch',poles:4,cutoff:4200,amount:-3.6,mode:'follow',invert:true,attack:6,release:70,drive:12,resonance:1.4,level:5,threshold:.14,sensitivity:7});
add('v-velvet-exhale',phantom,'Velvet exhale','A deep pink low-pass follower softens V into a velvet exhalation. A 24 ms attack and 240 ms release make a gently breathing alternative to the bank\'s sharp consonant patches.','V',{poles:16,cutoff:55,amount:7.1,mode:'follow',attack:24,release:240,drive:1,resonance:.75,level:12,threshold:.08,sensitivity:8});
